# The DSP library's sources, in link order: the source list of dsplib.mk (the library's build fragment).
# The order is the order of the objects in the archive; it is kept explicit instead of a $(wildcard), whose result depends on the build machine's locale.
# Renaming / moving a source: change its path here IN PLACE; adding one: append it.  `python3 tools/port_objs.py check` verifies that every
# .c / .cpp under the include root is listed exactly once.
#
# Paths are relative to the repository root.  DSP_INCDIR is the library's include root (-I), also relative to the repository root.
